@startuml ucm_class_diagram
title PM4Py-UCM Python domain model\n(UCM discovery + scenario synthesis from a process tree)

skinparam classFontStyle bold
skinparam classBackgroundColor white
skinparam classBorderColor #1E293B
skinparam classArrowColor #1E293B
skinparam packageStyle rectangle
skinparam packageBackgroundColor #F8FAFC
skinparam packageBorderColor #475569
skinparam noteBackgroundColor #FEF9E7
skinparam noteBorderColor #B7950B
skinparam shadowing false

hide empty members
hide empty methods

' ===========================================================
' Root container — the UCM (URN spec restricted to UCM)
' ===========================================================
class UCM <<container>> #DBEAFE {
    + name : str
    + description : str
    + author : str
    + maps : List<UCMmap>
    + responsibilities : List<Responsibility>
    + components : List<ComponentElement>
    + enumeration_types : List<EnumerationType>
    + variables : List<Variable>
    + scenario_groups : List<ScenarioGroup>
    --
    + add_map(name) : UCMmap
    + get_or_add_responsibility(name) : Responsibility
    + get_or_add_component(name, kind) : ComponentElement
    + get_or_add_enumeration_type(name, values) : EnumerationType
    + get_or_add_variable(name, type, enum) : Variable
    + add_scenario_group(name) : ScenarioGroup
    + bind_performers(mapping)
}

' ===========================================================
' Abstract base for every URN model element
' ===========================================================
abstract class URNmodelElement {
    + id : int
    + name : str
    + description : str
    + metadata : List<Metadata>
}

class Metadata <<value>> #FEF3C7 {
    + name : str
    + value : str
}

URNmodelElement "1" *-- "0..*" Metadata : metadata

' ===========================================================
' UCMmap — a single diagram (one entry in UCM.maps)
' ===========================================================
class UCMmap {
    + nodes : List<PathNode>
    + connections : List<NodeConnection>
    + cont_refs : List<ComponentRef>
}

URNmodelElement <|-- UCMmap
UCM "1" *-- "0..*" UCMmap : maps

' ===========================================================
' URN-level "definition" half of the URN duality
' ===========================================================
package "Definitions (URN-level)" as defs <<Folder>> {

    class Responsibility #CCFBF1 {
        + expression : str
        + performer : ComponentElement?
    }

    class ComponentElement #CCFBF1 {
        + kind : Kind
    }

    enum Kind {
        TEAM
        OBJECT
        PROCESS
        AGENT
        ACTOR
        ISR
        OTHER
    }
}

URNmodelElement <|-- Responsibility
URNmodelElement <|-- ComponentElement
ComponentElement +-- Kind

UCM "1" *-- "0..*" Responsibility : responsibilities
UCM "1" *-- "0..*" ComponentElement : components

Responsibility "0..*" --> "0..1" ComponentElement : performer

' ===========================================================
' Map-level "reference" half — PathNode hierarchy + ComponentRef
' ===========================================================
package "References (Map-level)" as refs <<Folder>> {

    abstract class PathNode {
        + x : int
        + y : int
        + width : int
        + height : int
        + pred_connections : List<NodeConnection>
        + succ_connections : List<NodeConnection>
        + cont_ref : ComponentRef?
    }

    class StartPoint {
        + pre_condition : Condition?
    }
    class EndPoint {
        + post_condition : Condition?
    }
    class EmptyPoint
    class RespRef {
        + resp_def : Responsibility?
    }
    class OrFork
    class OrJoin
    class AndFork
    class AndJoin
    class WaitingPlace
    class Timer
    class Connect
    class DirectionArrow
    class FailurePoint
    class Anything
    class Stub {
        + dynamic : bool
        + bindings : List<PluginBinding>
    }

    PathNode <|-- StartPoint
    PathNode <|-- EndPoint
    PathNode <|-- EmptyPoint
    PathNode <|-- RespRef
    PathNode <|-- OrFork
    PathNode <|-- OrJoin
    PathNode <|-- AndFork
    PathNode <|-- AndJoin
    PathNode <|-- WaitingPlace
    PathNode <|-- Connect
    PathNode <|-- DirectionArrow
    PathNode <|-- FailurePoint
    PathNode <|-- Anything
    PathNode <|-- Stub
    WaitingPlace <|-- Timer

    class ComponentRef #E0F2FE {
        + x : int
        + y : int
        + width : int
        + height : int
        + cont_def : ComponentElement
        + parent : ComponentRef?
        + children : List<ComponentRef>
    }

    ComponentRef "0..*" --> "0..1" ComponentRef : parent
}

URNmodelElement <|-- PathNode
URNmodelElement <|-- ComponentRef

UCMmap "1" *-- "0..*" PathNode : nodes
UCMmap "1" *-- "0..*" ComponentRef : cont_refs

' The two definition/reference back-pointers (the URN duality)
RespRef "0..*" --> "0..1" Responsibility : resp_def
ComponentRef "0..*" --> "1" ComponentElement : cont_def
PathNode "0..*" --> "0..1" ComponentRef : cont_ref

' ===========================================================
' Connections between path nodes
' ===========================================================
class NodeConnection {
    + threshold : float
}

class Condition <<value>> #FEF3C7 {
    + label : str
    + expression : str
    + description : str
    + delta_x : int
    + delta_y : int
}

URNmodelElement <|-- NodeConnection

UCMmap "1" *-- "0..*" NodeConnection : connections
NodeConnection --> "1" PathNode : source
NodeConnection --> "1" PathNode : target
NodeConnection --> "0..1" Condition : condition
StartPoint --> "0..1" Condition : pre_condition
EndPoint --> "0..1" Condition : post_condition

' ===========================================================
' Stub / plug-in binding machinery (multi-map UCMs)
' ===========================================================
package "Plug-in binding (Stub <-> sub-map)" as bind <<Folder>> {

    class PluginBinding {
        + precondition : Condition?
    }
    class InBinding
    class OutBinding
}

Stub "1" *-- "0..*" PluginBinding : bindings
PluginBinding --> "1" UCMmap : plugin
PluginBinding "1" *-- "0..*" InBinding : in_bindings
PluginBinding "1" *-- "0..*" OutBinding : out_bindings

InBinding  --> "1" NodeConnection : stub_entry
InBinding  --> "1" StartPoint     : start_point
OutBinding --> "1" EndPoint       : end_point
OutBinding --> "1" NodeConnection : stub_exit
PluginBinding --> "0..1" Condition : precondition

' ===========================================================
' Scenario layer — executable scenarios (variant / data-driven)
' ===========================================================
package "Scenario layer (URN-level)" as scn <<Folder>> {

    class EnumerationType #FDE68A {
        + values : List<str>
    }

    class Variable #FDE68A {
        + type : str
        ' "enumeration" | "integer" | "boolean"
    }

    class ScenarioGroup #FDE68A {
        + scenarios : List<ScenarioDef>
    }

    class ScenarioDef #FDE68A {
        + initializations : List<Initialization>
        + start_points : List<ScenarioStartPoint>
        + end_points : List<ScenarioEndPoint>
    }

    class Initialization <<value>> #FEF3C7 {
        + value : str
    }

    class ScenarioStartPoint <<value>> #FEF3C7 {
        + enabled : bool
    }

    class ScenarioEndPoint <<value>> #FEF3C7 {
        + enabled : bool
        + mandatory : bool
    }
}

URNmodelElement <|-- EnumerationType
URNmodelElement <|-- Variable
URNmodelElement <|-- ScenarioGroup
URNmodelElement <|-- ScenarioDef

UCM "1" *-- "0..*" EnumerationType : enumeration_types
UCM "1" *-- "0..*" Variable        : variables
UCM "1" *-- "0..*" ScenarioGroup   : scenario_groups

Variable "0..*" --> "0..1" EnumerationType : enumeration_type

ScenarioGroup "1" *-- "0..*" ScenarioDef : scenarios

ScenarioDef "1" *-- "0..*" Initialization      : initializations
ScenarioDef "1" *-- "0..*" ScenarioStartPoint  : start_points
ScenarioDef "1" *-- "0..*" ScenarioEndPoint    : end_points

Initialization      --> "1" Variable   : variable
ScenarioStartPoint  --> "1" StartPoint : start_point
ScenarioEndPoint    --> "1" EndPoint   : end_point

' ===========================================================
' Notes
' ===========================================================
note as N1
  **Definitions vs References — the URN duality**
  Each domain concept exists once as a URN-level **definition**
  (Responsibility / ComponentElement) and zero or more times as
  a map-level **reference** (RespRef / ComponentRef).
  resp_def and cont_def are the back-pointers; cont_ref on a
  PathNode declares which component rectangle visually contains it.
end note

defs .. N1
N1 .. refs

note as N2
  **Scenario synthesis**
  `pm4py_ucm.discover_scenarios` populates the scenario layer:
    • one **EnumerationType** ``VariantId`` + one **Variable**
      ``variant_id`` (variant-driven mode), OR one Variable per
      case-constant attribute mined from the log (data-driven).
    • one **integer Variable** per loop operator in the tree —
      the per-loop counter driving the LoopFork/LoopEntryGuard.
    • one **ScenarioGroup** ``MinedScenarios`` with one
      **ScenarioDef** per concurrency-aware variant, each with
      per-variable **Initialization**s and a single
      **ScenarioStartPoint** / **ScenarioEndPoint** wired to the
      map's entry/exit.
  Arc **Condition**s on OR-forks are set by the synthesizer
  in the same call and are what jUCMNav evaluates at runtime.
end note

scn .. N2

@enduml
